tpm 1
boot power
# select-moves: power-on (blank card) to the mode select as boot-select. Every D-pad move from
# every item (Right x5, Left x5, Down x5, Up x5 walk all 20 neighbours), Right+Up together (no
# move), Cross then Circle during the zoom (zoom-out), Cross then Circle on the zoomed item
# (zoom-out), then Cross, Cross on Classic: SELECT exits to NOMAL.EXE (not traced).
program SW_ON
program TIT_DEMO
100 1 START
program TITLE
100 1 START
program SELECT
70 2 RIGHT
+8 2 RIGHT
+8 2 RIGHT
+8 2 RIGHT
+8 2 RIGHT
+8 2 LEFT
+8 2 LEFT
+8 2 LEFT
+8 2 LEFT
+8 2 LEFT
+8 2 DOWN
+8 2 DOWN
+8 2 DOWN
+8 2 DOWN
+8 2 DOWN
+8 2 UP
+8 2 UP
+8 2 UP
+8 2 UP
+8 2 UP
+8 2 RIGHT+UP
+10 2 CROSS
+8 2 CIRCLE
+30 2 CROSS
+30 2 CIRCLE
+30 2 CROSS
+30 2 CROSS
